  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cure Tuberculosis Project 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The USAID Cure Tuberculosis project assists the Kyrgyz government to diagnose, treat, and cure people with drug-resistant tuberculosis. The project works to strengthen systems, tools, resources, and human capacity to improve the Kyrgyz Republics response to tuberculosis in line with international recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
